      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "町や村を巡って、きみの踊りで、\nそこの人たちに、生きる希望を与えてやってほしい。\n行って欲しい場所は４箇所だ。\nそこが復興したら訪ねてやってくれ。",
        "official_en": "I'd like for you to visit some villages and use your\ndancing to inspire them... Make their lives a little\neasier. Please visit them all after they've been rebuilt.",
